NAME
    gcloud beta memorystore acl-policies - manage Acl Policy resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta memorystore acl-policies COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Manage Acl Policy resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        (BETA) Create aclPolicies.

     delete
        (BETA) Delete aclPolicies.

     describe
        (BETA) Describe aclPolicies.

     list
        (BETA) List aclPolicies.

     update
        (BETA) Update aclPolicies.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. These
    variants are also available:

        $ gcloud memorystore acl-policies

        $ gcloud alpha memorystore acl-policies

